n solve for $x:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}2x-3 & =\\frac{2\\operatorname{log}⁡(7)}{3\\operatorname{log}⁡(11)} \\\\ 2x & =\\frac{2\\operatorname{log}⁡(7)}{3\\operatorname{log}⁡(11)}+3 \\\\ x & =\\frac{\\operatorname{log}⁡(7)}{3\\operatorname{log}⁡(11)}+\\frac{3}{2}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nEvaluating the above on a calculator gives\n\n$$\nx≈1.771\n$$\n\nrounded to $3$ decimal places."] ["question-fa39cf5e-b1cf-510a-a444-4f30da1c63f4" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard] ["answer-field-335d885a-d13c-55bb-8478-3d052924914c" :answer-field/id #uuid "335d885a-d13c-55bb-8478-3d052924914c"] ["answer-9762dcaa-9d7a-5565-8692-82ad8a90275e" :answer/id #uuid "9762dcaa-9d7a-5565-8692-82ad8a90275e"] ["answer-9762dcaa-9d7a-5565-8692-82ad8a90275e" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-9762dcaa-9d7a-5565-8692-82ad8a90275e" :answer/value "-1.771"] ["answer-0f642b7e-3aa4-589d-b5d0-69cd84cc61e8" :answer/id #uuid "0f642b7e-3aa4-589d-b5d0-69cd84cc61e8"] ["answer-0f642b7e-3aa4-589d-b5d0-69cd84cc61e8" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-0f642b7e-3aa4-589d-b5d0-69cd84cc61e8" :answer/value "-2.041"] ["answer-b59296e7-69ea-5b0f-8c88-fdca508c6ae7" :answer/id #uuid "b59296e7-69ea-5b0f-8c88-fdca508c6ae7"] ["answer-b59296e7-69ea-5b0f-8c88-fdca508c6ae7" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-b59296e7-69ea-5b0f-8c88-fdca508c6ae7" :answer/value "1.771"] ["answer-4e71bb66-f31b-56f1-8b96-dceb6bb51802" :answer/id #uuid "4e71bb66-f31b-56f1-8b96-dceb6bb51802"] ["answer-4e71bb66-f31b-56f1-8b96-dceb6bb51802" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-4e71bb66-f31b-56f1-8b96-dceb6bb51802" :answer/value "1.911"] ["answer-6a7282e0-ffd3-5bad-a6f6-578fd6e4195e" :answer/id #uuid "6a7282e0-ffd3-5bad-a6f6-578fd6e4195e"] ["answer-6a7282e0-ffd3-5bad-a6f6-578fd6e4195e" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-6a7282e0-ffd3-5bad-a6f6-578fd6e4195e" :answer/value "2.041"] ["answer-field-335d885a-d13c-55bb-8478-3d052924914c" :answer-field/key "selection"] ["answer-field-335d885a-d13c-55bb-8478-3d052924914c" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio] ["answer-field-335d885a-d13c-55bb-8478-3d052924914c" :answer-field/correct "answer-b59296e7-69ea-5b0f-8c88-fdca508c6ae7"] ["answer-field-335d885a-d13c-55bb-8478-3d052924914c" :answer-field/choices "answer-9762dcaa-9d7a-5565-8692-82ad8a90275e"] ["answer-field-335d885a-d13c-55bb-8478-3d052924914c" :answer-field/choices "answer-0f642b7e-3aa4-589d-b5d0-69cd84cc61e8"] ["answer-field-335d885a-d13c-55bb-8478-3d052924914c" :answer-field/choices "answer-b59296e7-69ea-5b0f-8c88-fdca508c6ae7"] ["answer-field-335d885a-d13c-55bb-8478-3d052924914c" :answer-field/choices "answer-4e71bb66-f31b-56f1-8b96-dceb6bb51802"] ["answer-field-335d885a-d13c-55bb-8478-3d052924914c" :answer-field/choices "answer-6a7282e0-ffd3-5bad-a6f6-578fd6e4195e"] ["question-fa39cf5e-b1cf-510a-a444-4f30da1c63f4" :question/answer-fields "answer-field-335d885a-d13c-55bb-8478-3d052924914c"] [17592186110594 :knowledge-point/questions "question-fa39cf5e-b1cf-510a-a444-4f30da1c63f4"] ["question-e0b9a214-575e-56bc-9016-1d953bb568c0" :question/id #uuid "e0b9a214-575e-56bc-9016-1d953bb568c0"] ["question-e0b9a214-575e-56bc-9016-1d953bb568c0" :question/math-academy-id "q-100254"] ["question-e0b9a214-575e-56bc-9016-1d953bb568c0" :question/problem "Given that ${7}^{5x}+8=34,$ find the value of $x$ rounded to $3$ decimal places."] ["question-e0b9a214-575e-56bc-9016-1d953bb568c0" :question/worked-solution "First, we rearrange our equation into a form that is more convenient for logarithms, as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{7}^{5x}+8 & =34 \\\\ {7}^{5x} & =26\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, we take ${log}_{7}$ of both sides of the equation and solve for $x$:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{7}^{5x} & =26 \\\\ {log}_{7}⁡({7}^{5x}) & ={log}_{7}⁡(26) \\\\ 5x & ={log}_{7}⁡(26) \\\\ x & =\\frac{1}{5}{log}_{7}⁡(26)\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nEvaluating the above on a calculator gives\n\n$$\nx≈0.335\n$$\n\nrounded to $3$ decimal places."] ["question-e0b9a214-575e-56bc-9016-1d953bb568c0" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate] ["answer-field-e8491df2-d5c3-5271-8329-efe669739dd5" :answer-field/id #uuid "e8491df2-d5c3-5271-8329-efe669739dd5"] ["answer-9be72108-4bdd-5fab-a923-17cc67035375" :answer/id #uuid "9be72108-4bdd-5fab-a923-17cc67035375"] ["answer-9be72108-4bdd-5fab-a923-17cc67035375" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-9be72108-4bdd-5fab-a923-17cc67035375" :answer/value "0.303"] ["answer-437278c9-7a76-5f2e-b4a6-02500ee6a3f2" :answer/id #uuid "437278c9-7a76-5f2e-b4a6-02500ee6a3f2"] ["answer-437278c9-7a76-5f2e-b4a6-02500ee6a3f2" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-437278c9-7a76-5f2e-b4a6-02500ee6a3f2" :answer/value "0.335"] ["answer-c72edcf4-d019-51c5-b9b0-7370b8b2c4d5" :answer/id #uuid "c72edcf4-d019-51c5-b9b0-7370b8b2c4d5"] ["answer-c72edcf4-d019-51c5-b9b0-7370b8b2c4d5" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-c72edcf4-d019-51c5-b9b0-7370b8b2c4d5" :answer/value "0.350"] ["answer-310d0146-d260-5636-89ab-ecc12e622eae" :answer/id #uuid "310d0146-d260-5636-89ab-ecc12e622eae"] ["answer-310d0146-d260-5636-89ab-ecc12e622eae" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-310d0146-d260-5636-89ab-ecc12e622eae" :answer/value "0.353"] ["answer-7d7a2b6a-8f01-536e-a4bb-dec07965bb90" :answer/id #uuid "7d7a2b6a-8f01-536e-a4bb-dec07965bb90"] ["answer-7d7a2b6a-8f01-536e-a4bb-dec07965bb90" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-7d7a2b6a-8f01-536e-a4bb-dec07965bb90" :answer/value "0.533"] ["answer-field-e8491df2-d5c3-5271-8329-efe669739dd5" :answer-field/key "selection"] ["answer-field-e8491df2-d5c3-5271-8329-efe669739dd5" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio] ["answer-field-e8491df2-d5c3-5271-8329-efe669739dd5" :answer-field/correct "answer-437278c9-7a76-5f2e-b4a6-02500ee6a3f2"] ["answer-field-e8491df2-d5c3-5271-8329-efe669739dd5" :answer-field/choices "answer-9be72108-4bdd-5fab-a923-17cc67035375"] ["answer-field-e8491df2-d5c3-5271-8329-efe669739dd5" :answer-field/choices "answer-437278c9-7a76-5f2e-b4a6-02500ee6a3f2"] ["answer-field-e8491df2-d5c3-5271-8329